aloca_heap - creates and initializes an empty heap with a given capacity.
swap_arb - swaps two TArb nodes while rearranging the heap.
compare - compares nodes by frequency, then alphabetically by name when frequencies match.
heap_introducere - restores the heap property after insertion by moving a node upward.
heap_extragere - restores the heap property after extraction by moving a node downward.
inserare_heap - adds a node to the heap in the correct position.
extragere_minim - removes the node with the lowest frequency from the heap root.
aloca_arb - allocates a tree node with a frequency, name, and left and right children.
construieste_arbore - builds the tree by combining nodes from the heap.
afisare_arbore - prints the tree level by level (BFS) in frequency-name format.
eliberare_arbore - recursively frees the memory used by the tree.
eliberare_heap - frees the node array and the heap structure.
task2 - decodes a bit string into a sequence of words or leaves by traversing the tree.
task3 - finds a word or leaf in the tree and returns its binary code.
task4 - builds the path from the root to a specified leaf as a node list and returns its length.